代码执行或信息泄露。该漏洞影响 142.0.7444.59 之前版本的 Chrome 浏览器，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。用户需升级至 142.0.7444.59 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12438"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-10T20:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:23Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 142.0.7444.59 或更高版本（Linux/ChromeOS 平台），可通过 Chrome 内置更新或官方网站下载。Fedora 用户升级至 142.0.7444.162。如无法立即更新，可在浏览器中启用站点隔离（Site Isolation）并禁用 Ozone 相关实验性功能作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/433027577","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-124xx/CVE-2025-12438.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-12438.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0518.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0517","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0517.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12437","title":"Google Chrome PageInfo 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器的 PageInfo 组件中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，该漏洞源于对已释放内存对象的错误引用。攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面并诱使用户执行特定的 UI 手势交互，触发对已释放内存的访问，导致堆内存破坏。成功利用此漏洞可能导致敏感信息泄露、服务拒绝或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 142.0.7444.59 之前的所有版本，攻击需要用户交互配合（如点击恶意链接或访问恶意网页），降低了利用门槛，但危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12437"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-10T20:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:22Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 142.0.7444.59 或更高版本（Fedora 用户升级至 142.0.7444.162），可通过 Chrome 内置更新程序或访问 google.com/chrome 下载安装。如无法立即更新，可在浏览器中启用安全浏览（Safe Browsing）并避免点击可疑链接或与不可信页面交互。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/446294487","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12437.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12437.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-12437.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5fe4fb06582cbbd39c10cfbc884045e215a69cb5/2025/CVE-2025-12437.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/2025/CVE-2025-12437-callinston_CVE-2025-12437.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12437.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/74eb38d48bf4ff1f1c91e4f5d37b571a985efa6f/2025/CVE-2025-12437/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12437.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12437.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12437.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0517.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0516","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0516.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12436","title":"Google Chrome Extensions 策略绕过漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 142.0.7444.59 之前版本的扩展程序存在策略绕过漏洞（CWE-306：关键功能缺少认证）。攻击者通过诱使用户安装恶意扩展程序，利用特制的 Chrome 扩展可从进程内存中获取敏感信息，导致机密数据泄露。该漏洞可远程利用，无需认证但需要用户交互，攻击复杂度较高，CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12436"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-10T20:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:22Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2025-12436\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2025-12436\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"Google Chrome 扩展程序策略绕过漏洞\"\ndescription = \"Google Chrome 142.0.7444.59 之前版本的扩展程序存在策略绕过漏洞。攻击者通过诱使用户安装恶意扩展程序，利用精心构造的 Chrome 扩展程序可从进程内存中获取潜在的敏感信息，导致机密数据泄露。该漏洞需要用户交互且攻击复杂度较高，但无需特权即可远程利用。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 5.9\nsources = [\"cve\", \"nvd\", \"redhat\", \"tenable\"]\npublished = \"2025-11-10\"\nupdated = \"2025-11-10\"\nremediation = \"升级至 Google Chrome 142.0.7444.59 或更高版本。Fedora 42 用户应更新至 142.0.7444.162，其他基于 Chromium 的浏览器也应同步更新至对应修复版本。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-12436\", \"https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html\", \"https://crbug.com/40250210\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = []\nexp_urls = []\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z\"","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40054742","https