ome 浏览器存储模块竞态条件 UI 欺骗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome（Windows 平台）Storage 组件存在条件竞争漏洞（CWE-362）。远程攻击者可构造特制的 HTML 页面，通过社会工程学手段诱导用户执行特定的 UI 手势操作，从而触发竞态条件，实现 UI 界面欺骗攻击。成功利用此漏洞可导致低度机密性泄露（如窃取受限存储数据）及有限的服务可用性影响。该漏洞影响 Chrome 142.0.7444.59 之前版本，攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互配合，CVSS 评分 4.2，危害等级中危。Google 已在 Chrome 142.0.7444.59 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12434"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-10T20:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:22Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 142.0.7444.59 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 内置更新程序自动检查更新并重启浏览器完成升级。如无法立即更新，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 执行作为临时缓解措施，或限制用户访问不可信网页。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/337356054","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-124xx/CVE-2025-12434.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be